WEBVTT

00:04:58.316 --> 00:05:01.036
To become climate change refugees.

00:05:03.436 --> 00:05:05.756
I’m not even sure
who would even take us in.

00:05:06.636 --> 00:05:10.716
But to those who think
that we can just accept our fate,

00:05:10.716 --> 00:05:13.076
I want to say:

00:05:14.316 --> 00:05:17.876
Adaptation and Indigenous knowledge 
are the solutions.

00:05:20.316 --> 00:05:22.716
These islands are our ancestors,

00:05:22.716 --> 00:05:24.436
our predecessors,

00:05:24.436 --> 00:05:25.716
our homes.

00:05:27.796 --> 00:05:30.396
We are at the risk of losing all of that